			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 721280102,
					"content": "欸，等一会，这些箱子可不能随便打开。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721280103,
						721280105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿敬"
				},
				{
					"id": 721280103,
					"content": "这是你的箱子吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721280104
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721280104,
					"content": "那当然，这些箱子都是我特意放在这里的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721280106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿敬"
				},
				{
					"id": 721280106,
					"content": "这里面装着的，都是我特意搜集来的各种宝贝。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721280107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿敬"
				},
				{
					"id": 721280107,
					"content": "你想打开那些宝箱的话，倒也不是不行。不过嘛…你得给我点东西做交换。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721280108,
						721280110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿敬"
				},
				{
					"id": 721280108,
					"content": "是要摩拉吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721280109
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721280109,
					"content": "哈哈哈，倒也不用摩拉。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721280111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿敬"
				},
				{
					"id": 721280111,
					"content": "我想要的东西，是一种「海螺」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721280112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿敬"
				},
				{
					"id": 721280112,
					"content": "在海滩周围，应该能够找到很多这种海螺。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721280113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿敬"
				},
				{
					"id": 721280113,
					"content": "如果你想要打开宝箱，把里面的宝贝拿到手的话，就用那种海螺来和我交换吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721280114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿敬"
				},
				{
					"id": 721280114,
					"content": "不过嘛…我不会告诉你这些宝箱里究竟有什么，到底能拿到什么宝贝，主要还是得看你的运气啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721280115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿敬"
				},
				{
					"id": 721280115,
					"content": "怎么样，如果你想打开这些宝箱的话，就把那种海螺拿给我吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "阿敬"
				},
				{
					"id": 721280110,
					"content": "你要什么东西？",
