					"nextDialogs": [
						721280503
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721280503,
					"content": "你倒是很敏锐嘛，没错，我就是在搜集这种海螺。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721280504
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿敬"
				},
				{
					"id": 721280504,
					"content": "但搜集这些海螺的原因我暂时不能和你说。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721280505,
						721280509
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿敬"
				},
				{
					"id": 721280505,
					"content": "是有什么特别之处吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721280506
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721280506,
					"content": "从做生意的角度来说，当然有特别之处了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721280507
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿敬"
				},
				{
					"id": 721280507,
					"content": "「曾经被祟神影响的海螺」…哈哈哈，肯定能卖出一个好价钱！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721280508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿敬"
				},
				{
					"id": 721280508,
					"content": "咳！总之，你把那种海螺拿来给我，就能打开宝箱，知道了吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721280511
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿敬"
				},
				{
					"id": 721280511,
